        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Apes are taking over!! In Apes vs. Everyone, step into the minds of greedy apes on a mission for destruction. Conquer 5 unique areas with a total of 80 levels, and play 5 minigames. Unleash chaos and rip through your enemies! Test your luck to see if you have the chops to conquer the world in the name of ape glory! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/19f84cac9f285dad4956d1a724d9d527.avif?t=1762804565\" width=742 height=356 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the humans by flinging your gorillas at their defenses! Collect as many stars as you can to unlock the next area! Collect all the stars in a world to unlock an extra area specific challenge or minigame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/392e85490a947b01d780c3bfb1450488.avif?t=1762804565\" width=704 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/c24f79eca58708692e7e404d35c3cb71.webp?t=1762804565\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068710/extras/c24f79eca58708692e7e404d35c3cb71.poster.avif?t=1762804565\" class=\"bb_img\" width=460 height=440 /></picture></span> </p>",
